    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2903795587977216
    m_Localized: Stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2903795613143040
    m_Localized: Select an effect, then replay it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2903795625725952
    m_Localized: 'Arrows / D-pad: browse | Enter / confirm: play

      Space: replay
      | Esc / back: stop'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914088892338176
    m_Localized: 01 - Geyser pillar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914088963641344
    m_Localized: A layered geyser erupts from a gathering pool, wearing a foam skirt
      and bursting crests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914099914969088
    m_Localized: 02 - Pillar ring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914099914969089
    m_Localized: Four pillars erupt around the player, one on each pulse, and collapse
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914110971154432
    m_Localized: 03 - Twin waves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914110971154433
    m_Localized: Two curling waves rise on either side and tip over the player before
      breaking apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914122006368256
    m_Localized: 04 - Vortex spiral
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914122006368257
    m_Localized: Twisted water sheets spin upward around the player and fling tangential
      spray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914132294995968
    m_Localized: 05 - Spiral ribbons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914132294995969
    m_Localized: Foam-headed ribbons spiral upward around a thin core; each pulse
      launches a new set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914141807677440
    m_Localized: 06 - Splash crown
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914141807677441
    m_Localized: A jagged splash crown erupts and re-bursts on each pulse with a
      droplet fountain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914152482181120
    m_Localized: 07 - Ring wall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914152482181121
    m_Localized: A hollow water wall rises around the player; foam bands climb it
      on each pulse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914162481401856
    m_Localized: 08 - Tiered fountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914162481401857
    m_Localized: A central jet stacks a new overflowing tier on each pulse, dripping
      into the pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914174762323968
    m_Localized: 09 - Jellyfish dome
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914174762323969
    m_Localized: A jet mushrooms into a pulsing dome that trails dripping tendrils.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914184023347200
    m_Localized: 10 - Lotus bloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2914184023347201
    m_Localized: Six curled petals rise and open around the player, with a foam heart
      on each pulse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
